  "body": "Sitting high and proud above the rest, this 1,256m² freehold site commands sweeping panoramic views from lush parklands to the sea and beyond. No interruption, no risk of being built out — just a clean vista of green parkland, open sky, and shimmering sea.\r\n\r\nQuietly positioned, yet steps from the park, pristine beaches, inviting cafés and refined amenities, this elevated setting balances effortless living with absolute presence and rare optionality.\r\n\r\nGeotechnical and civil reports are available, with a previously approved three-lot resource consent (now lapsed), providing a clear foundation for what could be realised here — not merely a build, but a statement.\r\n\r\nCombined with the future development, this property may be well suited to purchasers seeking to qualify under the Active Investor Plus (AIP) category, subject to independent legal advice.",
